lemma read_zero_tensor (x:UV three)(f g:Test4): tensorExperimentGap (model:=model) dF (roles.DeckLiftVU i x) f g=0 ∧ tensorExperimentGap (model:=model) (roles.DeckLiftVU i x) dF g f=0:=by
 obtain ⟨u,v⟩:= symmetricWard Certificate i E x; unfold tensorExperimentGap; rw [sleeps_read Certificate _ _ u,sleeps_read Certificate _ _ v,solitary_pay Certificate i E]; simp

